namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamRadioButton {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRadioButton.h#DreamRadioButton
    src   "A radio button whose hierarchy is code, not an asset.\n\nThe toggle's anatomy with the toggle's own behaviour underneath -- a box, a mark centred in it, a\nlabel beside it in a row -- differing in exactly two places, which is why it is a class and not a\nstyle: the mark is an image dot sized by the style rather than a glyph, and the box's corner\nradius defaults to half its size, which is the whole of what makes it read as a radio.\n\nWhat makes a radio a radio at runtime is the GROUP, and the group is not this control's: it is a\nUUIToggleGroup behaviour living on a shared ancestor, and membership is handed over through\nSetToggleGroup. Ungrouped, this control is honest about being a round toggle -- clicking it again\nturns it off; a group with bAllowNoneSelected=false is what forbids that.\n\n    /Script/DreamGUIControls.DreamRadioButton OptionA {\n        bIsOn = true\n        OnToggleChanged -> HandleOptionA\n    }"
    text  "层级由代码而非资源构成的单选按钮。\n\n沿用开关的结构，底层是开关自身的行为——一个方框、居中于其中的标记、\n同一行上位于其旁的标签——仅有两处不同，这正是它是类而不是样式的原因：\n标记是由样式决定尺寸的图像圆点，而不是字形；方框的圆角半径\n默认为其尺寸的一半，而正是这一点让它看起来像单选按钮。\n\n在运行时让单选按钮成为单选按钮的是组，而组并不属于此控件：它是\n位于共享祖先上的 UUIToggleGroup 行为，成员关系通过\nSetToggleGroup 移交。未分组时，此控件实际上就是一个圆形开关——再次点击\n会将其关闭；bAllowNoneSelected=false 的组才会禁止这一点。\n\n    /Script/DreamGUIControls.DreamRadioButton OptionA {\n        bIsOn = true\n        OnToggleChanged -> HandleOptionA\n    }"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButton:AcceptedMouseButtons {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRadioButton.h#DreamRadioButton:AcceptedMouseButtons
    src   "WHICH mouse buttons press and choose this radio -- a bitmask over EDreamUIMouseButtonType, the\nleft button alone by default: a radio is a check box to UMG, and SCheckBox answers the left\nbutton and nothing else, so a right click neither presses nor chooses it.\n\nUDreamButton's knob, with the same spelling (in .dui a number, one bit per\nEDreamUIMouseButtonType value: 1 is Left, 4 is Right). A touch and a gamepad or keyboard press\nalways count. Pushed onto the behaviour with the rest of the look."
    text  "哪些鼠标按键按下并选中此单选按钮——EDreamUIMouseButtonType 的位掩码，\n默认只有左键：对 UMG 而言单选按钮就是一个复选框，而 SCheckBox 只响应左键、\n别的都不响应，因此右键既不会按下也不会选中它。\n\nUDreamButton 的配置项，写法相同（在 .dui 中是一个数字，\n每个 EDreamUIMouseButtonType 值占一位：1 为 Left，4 为 Right）。触摸以及手柄或键盘按键\n始终有效。随其余外观一并推送到行为上。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButton:bAutoGroupWithSiblings {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRadioButton.h#DreamRadioButton:bAutoGroupWithSiblings
    src   "Find a UUIToggleGroup on an ancestor at Awake and join it -- with a group behaviour on the\nshared parent, sibling radios exclude each other with nothing wired. Default on, because a\nradio that does not exclude is a round toggle; off, grouping goes through SetToggleGroup."
    text  "Awake 时在祖先上查找 UUIToggleGroup 并加入它——在\n共享父级上放置一个组行为后，同级单选按钮无需任何连线即可互斥。默认开启，因为\n不互斥的单选按钮就是一个圆形开关；关闭后，分组需通过 SetToggleGroup 进行。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButton:bIsOn {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRadioButton.h#DreamRadioButton:bIsOn
    src   "Selected or not. A property rather than the getter/setter pair alone, because the pair alone\nis invisible: .dui writes properties, the designer lists properties, and a binding resolves a\nproperty. Authored value in, mirror of the behaviour's out -- HandleValueChanged keeps it\nhonest when the user (or the group switching this one off) is the writer."
    text  "是否已选中。这里用属性而不是仅提供 getter/setter 对，因为仅有这对函数\n是不可见的：.dui 写入的是属性，设计器列出的是属性，绑定解析的也是\n属性。写入的是编辑时的值，镜像的是行为对象的输出——当写入方是用户\n（或关闭此项的组）时，由 HandleValueChanged 保持其准确。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButton:CheckedState {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRadioButton.h#DreamRadioButton:CheckedState
    src   "The full state, in UMG's check-box vocabulary -- the same EDreamCheckState UDreamToggle carries,\nand the same three answers.\n\nA radio WITH a third state is not a contradiction: a mixed multi-select (\"these four objects\ndisagree about which option they are on\") is exactly the case Undetermined exists for, and it\nis as ordinary for a radio group as for a check box. The asymmetry with the toggle was the\ndefect -- one of the pair could say \"I do not know\" and the other could not.\n\nAuthorable, never clickable-into: the click lands as Checked -- a radio clicked is a radio chosen,\nwhich is what a group of them is for. The check box differs on purpose: it clears instead, because\nthat is UMG's SCheckBox rule, and UMG has no radio whose rule this could follow; a radio a click\nmerely cleared would take a second click to be chosen. The behaviour underneath stays two-state\nand is parked at unchecked while this stands, so the GROUP reads an undetermined radio as\nnot-selected -- which is the honest answer to \"is this the one\"."
    text  "完整状态，沿用 UMG 复选框的术语——即 UDreamToggle 携带的同一个 EDreamCheckState，\n同样三种取值。\n\n带第三态的单选按钮并不矛盾：混合多选（“这四个对象\n对它们各自处于哪个选项意见不一”）正是 Undetermined 存在的场合，\n对单选按钮组来说它与复选框一样普通。与开关之间的不对称才是\n缺陷——这一对里一个能说“我不知道”，另一个不能。\n\n可编辑，但永远不能通过点击进入：点击落定为 Checked——单选按钮被点击就是被选中，\n这正是单选按钮组的用途。复选框则有意不同：它会改为清除，因为\n那是 UMG 的 SCheckBox 规则，而 UMG 没有单选按钮可供遵循这条规则；一次点击\n只是清除的单选按钮需要再点一次才能被选中。底层的行为对象保持两态，\n在此状态生效期间停在未选中，因此组会把未确定的单选按钮读作\n未选中——这才是对“是不是它”的诚实回答。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButton:GetCheckedState {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRadioButton.h#DreamRadioButton:GetCheckedState
    src   "The full state. The behaviour is the truth for the two states it can hold; Undetermined is the\ncontrol's own and reads from here."
    text  "完整状态。对于行为对象能持有的两种状态，以行为对象为准；Undetermined 属于\n控件自身，从此处读取。"
    state machine
}

