}

DreamRadioButton:OnValueChangedBP {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRadioButton.h#DreamRadioButton:OnValueChangedBP
    src   "The `<->` convention: two-way bindings synthesize their reverse route against this exact\nname, so a value control carries it alongside its spoken events. Fires with them."
    text  "`<->` 约定：双向绑定会针对这个确切的\n名称合成其反向路由，因此值控件会连同它一起携带自身事件。与它们一同触发。"
    state machine
}

