DreamRadioButton:SetAutoGroupWithSiblings {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRadioButton.h#DreamRadioButton:SetAutoGroupWithSiblings
    src   "Turn the automatic grouping on or off, and act on it now.\n\nThe behaviour reads its own copy of this at Awake, so a radio created after begin play -- a\nlist of options built from save data, which is the ordinary case -- would otherwise never\nsearch at all. Turning it ON therefore does the search the behaviour would have done, and only\nwhen this radio is in no group yet.\n\nTurning it OFF leaves any group already joined alone: leaving is SetToggleGroup(null), which\nis a separate thing to want and already has a spelling."
    text  "开启或关闭自动分组，并立即生效。\n\n行为对象在 Awake 时读取自己的这份副本，因此在开始游戏之后创建的单选按钮——\n由存档数据构建的选项列表，也就是常见情形——否则根本不会\n进行查找。因此开启时会执行行为对象本应执行的查找，且仅在\n此单选按钮尚未加入任何组时才执行。\n\n关闭时不会影响已经加入的组：离开组是 SetToggleGroup(null)，\n那是另一种需求，且已有对应的写法。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButton:SetCheckedState {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRadioButton.h#DreamRadioButton:SetCheckedState
    src   "Set any of the three. Checked/Unchecked go through the behaviour WITH notify -- the path a\nclick takes, and the path the group hears -- while Undetermined parks the behaviour at\nunchecked without notify and lives on the control."
    text  "设置三种状态中的任意一种。Checked/Unchecked 带通知地经由行为对象处理——这是点击\n所走的路径，也是组能听到的路径——而 Undetermined 不通知，把行为对象停在\n未选中状态，自身则驻留在控件上。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButton:SetIsOn {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRadioButton.h#DreamRadioButton:SetIsOn
    src   "The compatibility spelling of SetCheckedState(Checked/Unchecked), exactly as on the toggle."
    text  "SetCheckedState(Checked/Unchecked) 的兼容写法，与开关上的完全一致。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButton:SetStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRadioButton.h#DreamRadioButton:SetStyle
